# 🚀 Todo App With Jenkins, Docker, AWS & CI/CD

A modern Todo Application built using **Node.js**, **Express.js**, and **EJS**, deployed on **AWS EC2** using **Docker** and automated through **Jenkins CI/CD Pipeline** with **GitHub Webhooks**.

---

# 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates a complete DevOps workflow from development to deployment.

```text
Developer
    ↓
Git Push
    ↓
GitHub Repository
    ↓
GitHub Webhook
    ↓
Jenkins Freestyle Job
    ↓
Docker Build
    ↓
Docker Container Deployment
    ↓
AWS EC2 Instance
    ↓
Application Available to Users
```

